How to Prepare
Practice coding problems daily on platforms like LeetCode, HackerRank, Codeforces.
Mock interviews with peers or platforms like Pramp, Interviewing.io.
Study system design basics using resources like "System Design Primer" on GitHub.
Improve communication skills by explaining solutions out loud.
